<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-119.2-investigation-case-management-and-retaliation-protection" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3721" name="W3721. Investigation Planning, Scoping &amp; Evidence Collection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Triaged case (W3717)
Frequency: Per case
Volume: Investigation caseload
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Lead Investigator
Participants: Lead Investigator, Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Legal (links to VS-100.3), LP (links to VS-23), HR (links to VS-19), IT/Security (links to VS-27.3), ABC (links to VS-86), Audit (links to VS-21), Records (links to VS-88), Forensic / Fraud Investigator
Source: workflow W3721 — Investigation Planning, Scoping &amp; Evidence Collection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3721_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3721_Lane1" name="Lead Investigator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3721_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3721_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3721_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3721_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3721_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3721_Start3" name="Triaged case (W3717)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3721_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3721_Task4" name="Lead Investigator plan and scope the investigation: define the allegation, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lead Investigator plan and scope the investigation: define the allegation, the investigation objectives, scope/limits, the investigation team (and independence/conflict-recusal), the evidence sources, and the investigation plan/SLA
Responsible (R): Lead Investigator / Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal, Forensic / Fraud Investigator
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3721_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3721_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3721_Task5" name="Lead Investigator collect and preserve evidence: documents/records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lead Investigator collect and preserve evidence: documents/records, system/transaction data, email/communications, CCTV (links to VS-23.2), access/system logs, and physical evidence; preserve chain-of-custody and apply legal-hold (links to VS-88.2)
Responsible (R): Lead Investigator / IT / LP / Records
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3721_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3721_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3721_Task6" name="Lead Investigator manage investigation confidentiality and need-to-know…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lead Investigator manage investigation confidentiality and need-to-know, coordinate with IT for data extraction (links to VS-27.3), and document the evidence record in case-management (links to W3720); flag any need for forensic specialists
Responsible (R): Lead Investigator / IT / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3721_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3721_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3721_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3721_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3721_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-587 (ensure controlled execution — Investigation, Case Management &amp; Retaliation Protection (PA-119.2).) | - operational: prompt preservation and legal-hold; operational: clear scoping
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Lead Investigator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3721_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3721_Annotation8" targetRef="W3721_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3721_Flow10" sourceRef="W3721_Start3" targetRef="W3721_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3721_Flow11" sourceRef="W3721_Task4" targetRef="W3721_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3721_Flow12" sourceRef="W3721_Task5" targetRef="W3721_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3721_Flow13" sourceRef="W3721_Task6" targetRef="W3721_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3721_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3721_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3721">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3721_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3721_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
