      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3724_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Audit verify action completion and effectiveness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Audit verify action completion and effectiveness, manage any appeals/grievances (links to VS-84.2), and document the action in case-management (links to W3720); report serious actions to the Ethics Committee (W3719) and board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR / Audit
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3724_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3724_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
