    <bpmn:process id="W_W3725" name="W3725. Retaliation Monitoring &amp; Protection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporter/witness/investigator involved in a case; retaliation report
Frequency: Continuous + on report
Volume: Reporters/witnesses across cases
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, HR (links to VS-19/VS-84), Legal (links to VS-100.3), the reporter/witness&#x27;s management, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3725 — Retaliation Monitoring &amp; Protection</bpmn:documentation>
