    <bpmn:process id="W_W3726" name="W3726. ABC/AML/Audit/Legal Investigation Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Case routed to a specialized track (W3717); cross-domain case
Frequency: Per case
Volume: Specialized-track cases
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, ABC/AML Officer (links to VS-86/W2943), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Legal (links to VS-100.3), LP (links to VS-23), HR (links to VS-19), Treasury (links to VS-18), Tax (links to VS-79)
Source: workflow W3726 — ABC/AML/Audit/Legal Investigation Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3726_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3726_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
