      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3726_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer coordinate ABC/AML-track cases with the ABC/AML…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer coordinate ABC/AML-track cases with the ABC/AML officer (links to VS-86.3/W2943): the ABC investigation (bribery, corruption, sanctions, suspicious-transaction) runs within the ABC program, the ethics program provides the speak-up channel, whistleblower coordination, and retaliation protection — W2943 is now this coordination track
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / ABC Officer
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3726_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3726_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3726_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer coordinate with Internal Audit (links to VS-21)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer coordinate with Internal Audit (links to VS-21) where a case indicates a control failure or financial-impact requiring audit follow-up/forensic-audit, and with Legal (links to VS-100) where the matter may escalate to litigation, regulatory, or law-enforcement
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Audit / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3726_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3726_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3726_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage cross-domain case integration: ensure the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage cross-domain case integration: ensure the matter is investigated once (not duplicated), evidence is shared appropriately, confidentiality is preserved across functions, and regulatory reporting (W3727) is triggered where required (e.g., AML STR/CTR links to VS-86.2, tax links to VS-79)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / ABC / Audit / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3726_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3726_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3726_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3726_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
