    <bpmn:process id="W_W3727" name="W3727. External/Regulatory Reporting &amp; Law-Enforcement Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Substantiated case with regulatory/legal threshold; mandatory reporting trigger
Frequency: On qualifying case
Volume: Qualifying cases
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Legal (links to VS-100.3), ABC/AML Officer (links to VS-86), Compliance (links to VS-22), Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36), External Counsel, Regulators (AMLC, SEC, BIR, DOLE, Ombudsman), Law Enforcement
Source: workflow W3727 — External/Regulatory Reporting &amp; Law-Enforcement Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3727_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3727_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3727_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3727_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3727_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
