      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3727_Start3" name="Substantiated case with regulatory/legal threshold; mandatory reporting trigger">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3727_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3727_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal assess external-reporting obligations…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal assess external-reporting obligations: determine which regulators/authorities must be notified (AMLC for money-laundering links to VS-86.2; Ombudsman/COA for B2G-related; BIR for tax; DOLE for labor; SEC for certain matters; NPC for data-privacy links to VS-91), the deadline, and the required content
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per qualifying case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3727_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3727_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3727_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal/External Counsel prepare and submit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal/External Counsel prepare and submit regulatory reports within deadlines, manage regulator inquiries, and coordinate law-enforcement referral where criminal conduct is indicated (links to VS-100 litigation)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal / External Counsel
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per qualifying case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3727_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3727_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3727_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer report external-reporting actions and regulator…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer report external-reporting actions and regulator engagement to the Ethics Committee (W3719) and board audit committee (links to VS-36); manage legal-hold and document retention for the matter (links to VS-88.2)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics Committee / Board Audit Committee
Duration: Per qualifying case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3727_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3727_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3727_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3727_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
