        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-158 (ensure whistleblower confidentiality &amp; non-retaliation.) | - operational: reporting-obligation assessment; operational: disclosure control
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
