    <bpmn:process id="W_W3728" name="W3728. Case Closure, Documentation &amp; Lessons Learned" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Case resolution (W3723/W3724)
Frequency: Per case
Volume: All cases
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19), Audit (links to VS-21), Records (links to VS-88), Analytics/BI (links to VS-28.1/VS-103.3), Risk (links to VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W3728 — Case Closure, Documentation &amp; Lessons Learned</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3728_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3728_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3728_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3728_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3728_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3728_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3728_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3728_Start3" name="Case resolution (W3723/W3724)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3728_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3728_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer close the case: confirm actions complete (W3724)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer close the case: confirm actions complete (W3724), retaliation monitoring period defined (W3725), reporter/subject notified appropriately, and the complete case record finalized in case-management (links to W3720) per retention (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3728_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3728_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3728_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer extract lessons learned: root cause…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer extract lessons learned: root cause, control/policy/training gaps, and preventive actions; feed to policy (W3714), training (W3718), risk assessment (W3730), and audit (links to VS-21) to prevent recurrence
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Audit / Risk
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3728_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3728_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3728_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Analytics aggregate case outcomes into program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Analytics aggregate case outcomes into program analytics (links to W3729) and report close-out metrics, recurring themes, and preventive-action status to the Ethics Committee (W3719) and governance (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / BI
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3728_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3728_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3728_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3728_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
